{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13105020","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13105020","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:0:1310502001:0":{"text":"那里曾是第一次神魔战争的战场，有许多勇士埋骨泥下。","source_cn":"那里曾是恶魔战争的一处战场，有许多勇士埋骨泥下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E904D6975032812","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1310502002:0":{"text":"战争结束后，那里突然长满了鲜花，即便冬季也从不衰败。","source_cn":"战争结束后，那里突然长满了鲜花，即便冬季也从不衰败。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47752C90950E891B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310502003:0":{"text":"或许真有英雄的灵魂寄托在那些花中吧……","source_cn":"或许真有英雄的灵魂寄托在那些花中吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9EEA9231301716C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:法拉莫尔":{"text":"法拉莫尔","source":"法拉莫尔","status":"source"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"漫漫","source":"漫漫","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}